  "body_html": "<p>Transform your bedroom into a court of dreams with this personalized sport comforter. Designed for true basketball fans, this custom bedding set allows you to add your own name and number, making it a truly unique piece of sports decor. Crafted from soft, lightweight, and durable brushed polyester fabric with a whole-piece microfiber filling, it provides the perfect balance of cozy warmth and lightweight comfort for all seasons.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Custom options let you add your own name (up to 30 characters) and number (up to 5 digits) for a one-of-a-kind bedding set.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Comfort &amp; Warmth:</strong> Made from 100% brushed polyester fabric with a whole-piece microfiber filling to prevent clumping or shifting.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Vibrant &amp; Durable:</strong> Advanced environmental protection finishing process ensures deep dye holding and prevents fading over time.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>All-Season Use:</strong> Lightweight, soft, and breathable material makes this comforter set perfect for comfortable use throughout the year.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water; dries quickly on low or no heat to restore its fluffy loft.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Cotton/ Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Basketball D13</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Basketball Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Compact</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>Name and Number (2 text inputs)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
